# Listening bugs
uplink-contraband-listening-bug-name = Covert Listening Bug
uplink-contraband-listening-bug-desc = Keep your enemies intentions known with this handy, hide able tool.

uplink-contraband-hidden-camera-kit-name = Hidden Camera Network Kit
uplink-contraband-hidden-camera-kit-desc = All the tools needed to make your own hidden camera network. Never let anyone sneak up on you again.

